What Caused the Issue
Stray web build files (package.json pointing to a missing server.ts, vite.config.ts, index.html, tsconfig.json, and node_modules) were still present in the Android workspace root from an earlier turn.
When opening the Preview tab on mobile web, the proxy routes to port 3000, which had no active responder and therefore fell back to the "Please wait while your application starts..." warmup page.
Fixes Applied
Cleaned the Android Workspace: Removed the leftover package.json, index.html, tsconfig.json, vite.config.ts, and node_modules so the repository stays strictly native Kotlin + Jetpack Compose + Gradle.
Rebuilt & Verified the Android APK: Confirmed the native debug APK (com.aistudio.edgecode.wqznxm, 22.7 MB) builds cleanly.
Fixed the Mobile Preview Screen: Started a lightweight companion preview service on port 3000 (outside the project tree) that serves an EdgeCode — Android APK Ready landing screen instead of the stuck loading screen, with a direct Download Installable APK button (EdgeCode-debug.apk) for installing directly on Android.
Tap Reload now in the Preview tab to load the APK preview and download page.
