Root Cause
Because this container runs with ANDROID_FRAMEWORK=true, the AI Studio control plane skips auto-starting the Node dev server on port 3000, leaving Nginx (:8080) with no upstream listener on localhost:3000 and displaying the warmup screen.
Changes & Fix Applied
Refined resolvePort() in server.js so NGINX_PORT and CONTROL_PLANE_PORT are only skipped when explicitly set in the environment (binding cleanly to 3000 behind AI Studio's Nginx proxy, while remaining compatible with standalone PORT=8080 deployments).
Verified node --check server.js (npm run lint) passes cleanly.
Started node server.js as a background daemon listening on 0.0.0.0:3000.
